# The committed demo single-files (demo/safeseed-demo.html, demo/safeseed-generator.html)
# are rebuilt and diffed by CI to catch staleness. Pin all HTML to LF so that rebuild
# diffs cleanly across OSes (vite/esbuild emit LF; this stops a Windows checkout's CRLF
# from showing as spurious drift).
*.html text eol=lf
# The favicon SVG is URL-encoded verbatim into those single-files at build time, so its
# line endings surface inside the HTML bytes. Same pin, same reason.
*.svg text eol=lf

# Run records hash the exact CSV bytes. Keep tracked fixtures byte-identical on
# Windows, Linux, and macOS instead of allowing Git to rewrite LF as CRLF.
*.csv text eol=lf

# The public GitHub Action executes the committed build directly. Keep generated
# runtime bytes stable across Windows development and Linux/macOS CI rebuilds.
dist/** text eol=lf
action/** text eol=lf
